le_tab","settings":{"heading":"Care & Details","heading_size":"medium","icon":"check_box","filled_icon":false,"collapse_icon":"carret","display_top_border":true,"open":false,"content":"<p>Spot clean with a damp cloth or hand wash gently to preserve the fleece fabric and smooth outer finish. Avoid bleach and high heat to keep the jacket soft, comfortable, and durable for everyday wear.<\/p><p>Each piece is thoughtfully made with a plush fleece interior that locks in warmth while remaining breathable against the skin. Slight variations in texture may occur, giving every jacket its own unique character.<\/p><p>To maintain the original fit and comfort, avoid machine drying or prolonged exposure to direct heat. This ensures the jacket stays cozy, stylish, and long-lasting.<\/p>","page":"","margin_top":0,"margin_bottom":0}},"collapsible_tab_aKAQRb":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"What Makes It Special?","heading_size":"medium","icon":"check_box","filled_icon":false,"collapse_icon":"carret","display_top_border":true,"open":false,"content":"<h4><strong>A Jacket with Everyday Luxury<\/strong><\/h4><p>Designed with a soft fleece fabric and a high collar, this jacket brings together warmth and everyday comfort. The relaxed fit makes it easy to layer, while the sleek silhouette elevates your casual style. Perfect for crisp mornings, cool evenings, or relaxed weekends outdoors.<\/p><h4><strong>Why You’ll Love It<\/strong><\/h4><p>The plush fleece keeps you warm while remaining breathable, so you stay comfortable without overheating. A zip-up front makes it effortless to wear, and the adjustable hem allows for a personalized fit. With each wear, the jacket feels softer, molding to your shape and becoming a go-to favorite. The Fleece Collar Jacket is more than just outerwear — it’s a blend of everyday function and timeless style.<\/p>","page":"","margin_top":0,"margin_bottom":0}},"collapsible_tab_q8L4T9":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Shipping & Returns","heading_size":"medium","icon":"check_box","filled_icon":false,"collapse_icon":"carret","display_top_border":true,"open":false,"content":"<p><strong>Shipping<\/strong><\/p><p>All Orders are fulfilled and then shipped out to anywhere in the <strong>United States<\/strong> in <strong>1-3 working days<\/strong> on average.<\/p><p>Worldwide shipping (other than US) takes 4-8 working days depending on location:<\/p><ul><li>Europe: 4-8 days<\/li><li>Australia: 4-8 days<\/li><li>United Kingdom: 4-8 days<\/li><li>Canada: 4-8 days<\/li><li>Rest of world: 4-8 days<\/li><\/ul><p>All orders come with tracking information once shipped.<\/p><p><strong>Returns<\/strong><\/p><p>Not happy with your purchase? No worries, we've got you covered! <br\/><br\/>You may return it within 30 days of delivery for a full refund or exchange, no questions asked. To initiate a return, just contact our customer service team at support@thefleececompany.com.<\/p>","page":"","margin_top":24,"margin_bottom":0}}},"block_order":["title","a6eb81db-40e4-43e0-972f-32db010a4a56","trustpilot_stars_KYcqrm","price","icon_with_text_Te9ghg","text_rLt9Cx","text_nGkPrV","text_jVhjJn","5fcc0428-e768-4cb7-bea3-eb0274198dd1","kiwi_size_chart_recommender_kiwi_sizing_eWhFDh","04ba004e-2f54-4936-8b1c-8bcadf6573f6","kaching_bundles_app_block_jFPBYR","buy_buttons","payment_badges_GpQfFV","custom_liquid_zVCGiq","e0a0b690-50df-4ca4-acfd-ce2980696cce","e7a28cbe-03cb-4c9d-a2c4-0e3e76ffb3e5","icon_with_text_Vn6pTD","custom_liquid_697XWF","description","reviews_8UgFbe","de158e68-5d0d-4819-a625-e2dabdff87d1","collapsible_tab_aKAQRb","collapsible_tab_q8L4T9"],"custom_css":[],"settings":{"display_id":false,"enable_sticky_info":true,"display_variant_image_first":false,"disable_prepend":false,"hide_variants":false,"variant_image_filtering":"none","image_zoom":"none","arrows_color_scheme":"inverse","transparent_arrows":false,"dots_color_scheme":"inverse","video_player":"play_btn","enable_video_looping":false,"autoplay_videos_