"icon_with_text_Br7y3T","image_NLbKc7","icon_with_text_qTh6Qq"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"display_id":false,"visibility":"always-display","color_scheme":"background-1","columns_count":4,"column_gap_desktop":40,"row_gap_desktop":40,"desktop_vertical_alignment":"center","column_gap_mobile":20,"row_gap_mobile":30,"mobile_vertical_alignment":"flex-start","col_1_desktop_width":12,"col_1_mobile_width":4,"col_1_visibility":"always-display","col_2_desktop_width":4,"col_2_mobile_width":4,"col_2_visibility":"always-display","col_3_desktop_width":4,"col_3_mobile_width":4,"col_3_visibility":"always-display","col_4_desktop_width":4,"col_4_mobile_width":4,"col_4_visibility":"always-display","col_5_desktop_width":3,"col_5_mobile_width":4,"col_5_visibility":"always-display","col_6_desktop_width":3,"col_6_mobile_width":4,"col_6_visibility":"always-display","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"custom_colors_background":"#ffffff","custom_gradient_background":"","custom_colors_text":"#2e2a39","custom_colors_solid_button_background":"#dd1d1d","custom_colors_solid_button_text":"#ffffff","custom_colors_outline_button":"#dd1d1d"}},"trustpilot_reviews_kGyPbx":{"type":"trustpilot-reviews","blocks":{"column_mpzd3U":{"type":"column","settings":{"star_color":"#00b67a","bg_star_color":"#c8c8c8","star_symbol_color":"#ffffff","stars_rating":5,"title":"Love my","text":"<p>Love my blanket. Not too hot or cold, best blanket purchase yet<\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Cheryl D<\/strong><\/em>"}},"column_67jPJ9":{"type":"column","settings":{"star_color":"#00b67a","bg_star_color":"#c8c8c8","star_symbol_color":"#ffffff","stars_rating":5,"title":"Exactly what I wanted","text":"<p>Exactly what I wanted. So soft and big. This is a family cuddle blanket<\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Daniela S<\/strong><\/em>"}},"column_nfBnNr":{"type":"column","settings":{"star_color":"#00b67a","bg_star_color":"#c8c8c8","star_symbol_color":"#ffffff","stars_rating":5,"title":"WAY better than expected","text":"<p>I've been wanting to get one of these since seeing it at a friend's house, & I'm obsessed. I'm 6'2\", & no blanket is ever really big enough. This thing goes on for days, it's incredible.<\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Derek H<\/strong><\/em>"}},"column_K9Rcka":{"type":"column","settings":{"star_color":"#00b67a","bg_star_color":"#c8c8c8","star_symbol_color":"#ffffff","stars_rating":5,"title":"Blanket","text":"<p>Wonderful. Love the color<\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Alyssa S<\/strong><\/em>"}},"column_38r9Qg":{"type":"column","settings":{"star_color":"#00b67a","bg_star_color":"#c8c8c8","star_symbol_color":"#ffffff","stars_rating":5,"title":"Amazing","text":"<p>Love the blankets. I bought one for myself and had to buy one for my husband because I love mine to much to share even though it’s big enough for both of us. Definitely have recommended these blankets to family and friends.<\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Author<\/strong><\/em>"}},"column_hmgeLr":{"type":"column","settings":{"star_color":"#00b67a","bg_star_color":"#c8c8c8","star_symbol_color":"#ffffff","stars_rating":5,"title":"5 Stars","text":"<p>These blankets are amazing! I have bought 3 and I don’t think I’ll ever be able to go back to any other kind. They keep me cool at night and I don’t have to fight for my side of the blanket because they’re so big. They’re very soft and feel slightly weighted but probably because of the size.<\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Ramon<\/strong><\/em>"}},"column_yJ3qyE":{"type":"column","settings":{"star_color":"#00b67a","bg_star_color":"#c8c8c8","star_symbol_color":"#ffffff","stars_rating":5,"title":"Awesome","text":"<p>Can't live without it!!!<\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Ricky<\/strong><\/em>"}},"column_er7rUH":{"type":"column","settings":{"star_color":"#00b67a","bg_star_color":"#c8c8c8","star_symbol_color":"#ffffff","stars_rating":5,"title":"Best Blanket Ever","text":"<p>This blanket is so soft! It’s cozy, and it doesn’t get too hot.<\/p>","author":"<em><strong>April J<\/strong><\/em>"}},"column_DjgVLg":{"type":"column","settings":{"star_color":"#00b67a","bg_star_color":"#c8c8c8","star_symbol_color":"#ffffff","stars_rating":5,"title":"Large and Cozy","text":"<p>Amazing quality and the embroidery is very nice and clean. Its actually threaded and stitched rather than just screen printed!<\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Colt G<\/strong><\/em>"}},"column_kY8BXf":{"type":"column","settings":{"star_color":"#00b67a","bg_star_color":"#c8c8c8","star_symbol_color":"#ffffff","stars_rating":5,"title":"Best fuzzy ever","text":"<p>These blankets are the absolute best<\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Jessie P<\/strong><\/em>"}}},"block_order":["column_mpzd3U","column_67jPJ9","column_nfBnNr","column_K9Rcka","column_38r9Qg","column_hmgeLr","column_yJ3qyE","column_er7rUH","column_DjgVLg","column_kY8BXf"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"display_id":false,"visibility":"always-display","color_scheme":"background-1","desktop_content_position":"above","desktop_content_alignment":"center","title":"Our customers speaking","title_highlight_color":"#6d388b","heading_size":"h1","subtitle":"Excellent [rating] <strong>\/ 5<\/strong> [rating_stars]","subheading_rating_text":"<strong>4.8<\/strong>","subheading_mobile_text_size":18,"subheading_desktop_text_size":20,"subheading_font":"body","star_color":"#00b67a","bg_star_color":"#c8c8c8","star_symbol_color":"#ffffff","stars_rating":5,"text":"","cards_border_radius":16,"card_alignment":"center","show_stars":true,"cards_color_scheme":"background-2","type":"slide","autoplay":false,"autoplay_speed":5,"arrows_color_scheme":"inverse","transparent_arrows":true,"dots_color_scheme":"inverse","desktop_full_page":false,"columns_desktop":3,"slider_desktop":true,"per_move_desktop":1,"desktop_spacing":24,"desktop_side_padding":0,"desktop_padding_calc":true,"desktop_adaptive_height":true,"desktop_dots_position":"under","desktop_arrows_position":"sides","slider_mobile":true,"enable_mobile_preview":false,"mobile_adaptive_height":true,"mobile_dots_position":"under","mobile_arrows_position":"under","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36,"custom_colors_background":"#ffffff","custom_gradient_background":"","custom_colors_text":"#2e2a39","custom_cards_colors_background":"#f3f3f3","custom_cards_gradient_background":"","custom_cards_colors_text":"#2e2a39"}},"testimonials_cEKGVw":{"type":"testimonials","blocks":{"column_zimpRM":{"type":"column","settings":{"title":"","text":"<p>This jacket is perfect for fall weather. It’s warm without being heavy and the high collar keeps the wind out. I wear it on my morning walks and always feel cozy.<\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Jennifer<\/strong><\/em>"}},"column_kDGGTp":{"type":"column","settings":{"title":"","text":"<p>I love how versatile this jacket is. I can zip it up when it’s chilly or leave it open over a tee for a casual look. The drawstring hem gives it a nice shape too.<\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Anne L.<\/strong><\/em>"}},"column_nW7tw8":{"type":"column","settings":{"title":"","text":"<p>Super soft and comfortable. I wish it had an inside pocket, but overall it’s a great everyday jacket and I’ve already gotten compliments on it.<\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Zoe <\/strong><\/em>"}},"column_RpyDhz":{"type":"column","settings":{"title":"","text":"<p>The fit is relaxed but still flattering. I usually wear a medium and it fits just right, with room for a sweater underneath. Definitely a staple in my closet now.<\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Irene <\/strong><\/em>"}},"column_tkyX7P":{"type":"column","settings":{"title":"","text":"<p>The fleece feels amazing and keeps me warm on cooler evenings. It doesn’t feel bulky, which I love. Looks great with jeans and leggings.<\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Elin<\/strong><\/em>"}},"column_pyHVGd":{"type":"column","settings":{"title":"","text":"<p>Really nice quality for the price. The zipper works smoothly and the collar adds a chic touch. I went up one size for a slightly oversized fit and it looks great.<\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Maria<\/strong><\/em>"}}},"b